  "recordedAt": "2026-06-11T13:00:00Z",
  "contextText": "Midpoint of the six-week Varden discovery. Rosa is out, Ben covering.",
  "hasTranscript": true,
  "speakers": [
    {
      "id": "m24-spk-a",
      "label": "A",
      "displayName": "Alex Rivera"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-spk-b",
      "label": "B",
      "displayName": "Ben Adeyemi"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-spk-c",
      "label": "C",
      "displayName": "Mateo Rossi"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-spk-d",
      "label": "D",
      "displayName": "Rosa Delgado"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m24-s001",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 5540,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks for joining. Rosa, good of you to dial in before your leave."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s002",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-d",
      "startMs": 5790,
      "endMs": 10570,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Just for the first part. Ben will take it from there."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s003",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-c",
      "startMs": 10820,
      "endMs": 17880,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'm Mateo Rossi, solutions architect at Larkspur. I've spent the last three weeks in the portal code."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s004",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-a",
      "startMs": 18130,
      "endMs": 20630,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Mateo, what did you find?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s005",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-c",
      "startMs": 20880,
      "endMs": 29080,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The biggest finding is call deflection. About 30 percent of claims calls are simple status checks the portal could answer."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s006",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-d",
      "startMs": 29330,
      "endMs": 34870,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That's the number I needed. It pays for the project on its own."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s007",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-c",
      "startMs": 35120,
      "endMs": 42560,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The second finding is that the policy API is old but stable. It's the portal layer that's rotten."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s008",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-b",
      "startMs": 42810,
      "endMs": 49490,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "So we rebuild the portal on top of the existing policy API rather than replacing it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s009",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-c",
      "startMs": 49740,
      "endMs": 54520,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That's my recommendation. Replacing the policy API is a multi-year programme."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s010",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-d",
      "startMs": 54770,
      "endMs": 61450,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Then let's decide it. We rebuild the portal on the existing policy API, not replace it."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s011",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-a",
      "startMs": 61700,
      "endMs": 65340,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Decided. Ben, anything that blocks the next phase?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s012",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-b",
      "startMs": 65590,
      "endMs": 71510,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "You need sandbox access to the policy API. I'll provide sandbox access by Friday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s013",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-c",
      "startMs": 71760,
      "endMs": 73120,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s014",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-a",
      "startMs": 73370,
      "endMs": 76250,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Mateo, what's next on your side?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s015",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-c",
      "startMs": 76500,
      "endMs": 82800,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "An integration spike against the sandbox. I'll produce the integration spike report in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s016",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-d",
      "startMs": 83050,
      "endMs": 86690,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll drop off now. Ben has my proxy."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s017",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-a",
      "startMs": 86940,
      "endMs": 89060,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Get well soon, Rosa."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s018",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-b",
      "startMs": 89310,
      "endMs": 96750,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "One heads-up. The CIO will want a cost breakdown before phase two, so build that into the readout."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s019",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-a",
      "startMs": 97000,
      "endMs": 99880,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Noted, we'll include a cost breakdown."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s020",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-c",
      "startMs": 100130,
      "endMs": 103390,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Ben, who owns the claims status data?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s021",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-b",
      "startMs": 103640,
      "endMs": 107280,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The claims operations team. I can introduce you."
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s022",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-a",
      "startMs": 107530,
      "endMs": 110030,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That would help. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m24-s023",
      "speakerId": "m24-spk-b",
      "startMs": 110280,
      "endMs": 112780,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "No, that's it from me."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Varden discovery midpoint review\n\n**Date:** June 11\n**Attendees:** Alex Rivera (Larkspur Labs), Mateo Rossi (Larkspur Labs), Ben Adeyemi (Varden Insurance), Rosa Delgado (Varden Insurance, first part)\n\n## Summary\n\nMidpoint review of the six-week discovery for the Varden Insurance claims portal rebuild. Rosa joined for the first part before her leave; Ben covers for her. Mateo Rossi, Larkspur's solutions architect, has spent three weeks in the portal code.\n\n## Findings\n\n- About 30 percent of claims calls are simple status checks the portal could answer. Rosa said that deflection alone pays for the project.\n- The policy API is old but stable; the portal layer is the problem.\n- Replacing the policy API would be a multi-year programme.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- **Rebuild the portal on top of the existing policy API**, rather than replacing the API.\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Ben Adeyemi** — provide sandbox access to the policy API by Friday; introduce Mateo to the claims operations team, who own the claims status data.\n- **Mateo Rossi** — produce the integration spike report against the sandbox in three weeks.\n- **Alex Rivera** — include a cost breakdown in the discovery readout.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Varden's CIO will want a cost breakdown before phase two.\n- Ben holds Rosa's proxy while she is out.\n"
  },
